{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48888","headline":"即目 · 李郢","name":"即目","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自笑腾腾者，非憨又不狂。\n何爲跧似鼠，而复怯於麞。\n落拓无生计，伶俜恋酒乡。\n冥搜得诗窟，偶战出文场。\n爱雪愁冬尽，怀人觉夜长。\n石楼多爽气，柽案有余香。\n运去非关拙，时来不在忙。\n平生两闲暇，孤趣满沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}